        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Changed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The llama.cpp engine is now v0.4.1.** Spire builds and signs llama.cpp v0.4.1 (commit &lt;code&gt;b29c606e&lt;/code&gt;), which adds newer model architectures, including the &lt;code&gt;qwen4exp&lt;/code&gt; architecture used by Qwen3.8-Flash-Next. Placements on earlier engines remain on their engine; the managed engine workflow archives that signature-verified engine when it upgrades them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731 keeps its qualified launch contract on v0.4.1.** The upstream chat template is byte-identical between v0.4.0 and v0.4.1 and is still digest-verified at build time and before every launch, so the template, DeepSeek reasoning format, maximum reasoning effort, and sampling settings apply on both engines. Other engines keep upstream template autodetection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
