        <description>&lt;h3&gt;Corrected&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**Hermes Chat avoids a stalled macOS open-file scan.** The listener check now reads the kernel TCP inventory and verifies its owner before connecting. This replaces the ineffective timeout increase in 1.7.11; unknown owners, conflicting processes, failed probes, and malformed responses still block access visibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
